DOMAIN,account.apple.com
DOMAIN,appleid.cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN,idmsa.apple.com
DOMAIN,gsa.apple.com

# ==========================================
# 五、推送通知 (APNs)
# 【关键】必须直连，否则消息延迟、省电失效
# 不要放行整段 17.0.0.0/8，否则媒体 CDN 也会被直连
# ==========================================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push-apple.com.akadns.net
IP-CIDR,17.249.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,17.252.0.0/16,no-resolve
