# ==========================================
# 十二、必须直连且不能落入 Applemedia 的 apple.com 兜底
# App Attest、Apple DoH、诊断资产、iCloud DNS、欺诈网站警告、Universal Links
# token.safebrowsing.apple 与 app-site-association.networking.apple 的后缀是 .apple
# ==========================================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appattest.apple.com
DOMAIN,doh.dns.apple.com
DOMAIN,diagassets.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,token.safebrowsing.apple
